WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.980
Tesla Registrations in Sweden rose 248% in October, while Norway climbed 131%, even as Chinese rivals expanded. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 653. Vietnam Terra filings, the end of vehicle referral rewards, and Texas Robotaxi Operations follow, then first principles. Denmark posted a 34% rise in Tesla Registrations in October, according to Big Go Finance. The rebound came from a low

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:36.620
prior year base, higher fuel prices, government subsidies, and continued electric vehicle or EV

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:43.660
demand growth. Mobility Sweden, OFV, and balestatsistic.dk supplied the country counts.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:49.800
United Kingdom and Germany figures are due later this week. Tesla reported a four-year high in

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:55.540
its passenger car order backlog at the end of the third quarter. Registration authorities in

00:00:55.540 --> 00:01:01.136
country showed the recovery momentum extending into the fourth quarter. Tesla recorded its

00:01:01.136 --> 00:01:07.176
best October ever in Norway. T.S. Alamming reported. The ranking among brands stayed close

00:01:07.176 --> 00:01:13.614
despite the volume increase. A delivery delay would not alter either result. Tesla and Samsung

00:01:13.614 --> 00:01:19.574
formally opposed potential new U.S. tariffs on Vietnamese goods ahead of the November 29th

00:01:19.574 --> 00:01:25.534
section 301 deadline. The news International reported. Tesla noted that certain advanced

00:01:25.534 --> 00:01:30.674
components and precision manufacturing equipment cannot be sourced domestically in sufficient

00:01:30.674 --> 00:01:36.474
quantities. Samsung highlighted Vietnam's role as a primary manufacturing base for smartphones

00:01:36.474 --> 00:01:42.874
and network equipment. The US probe targets alleged intellectual property violations and excessive

00:01:42.874 --> 00:01:49.274
capacity. The Trump administration designated Vietnam a priority foreign country. Submissions to

00:01:49.274 --> 00:01:55.514
the Office of the United States Trade Representative or USTR warned of severe supply chain disruptions

00:01:55.514 --> 00:01:58.574
and rising consumer costs if new duties take effect.

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:02.547
Purchase referral rewards for new Tesla vehicles have ended.

00:02:03.087 --> 00:02:04.227
Digital today reported.

00:02:04.827 --> 00:02:09.547
Tesla is shifting focus toward growing full self-driving or FSD subscriptions.

00:02:09.967 --> 00:02:14.687
The change removes an incentive that previously rewarded owners for new vehicle purchases.

00:02:15.782 --> 00:02:21.422
Dallas already operates a Robotaxi service using Model Y vehicles, TSLAMing noted.

00:02:21.902 --> 00:02:25.262
The rollout awaits cybercabs that can function in the same area.

00:02:25.262 --> 00:02:30.722
The current operation relies on existing model Y hardware, while waiting for the dedicated

00:02:30.722 --> 00:02:31.862
CyberCab variant.

00:02:32.899 --> 00:02:37.739
One Robotaxi ride in Houston stayed off Interstate Roots, Tesla Roddy reported.

00:02:38.239 --> 00:02:40.539
The distance was 74.1 miles.

00:02:41.059 --> 00:02:43.299
The trip lasted three hours and five minutes.

00:02:43.919 --> 00:02:46.599
The fare was $133.25.

00:02:47.219 --> 00:02:51.739
The run was described as flawless at roughly $1.80 per mile.

00:02:51.739 --> 00:02:56.905
The Geofence expanded through downtown on October 26th.

00:02:56.985 --> 00:03:03.965
Latvia approved FSD operations, trading view noted, Tesla holds roughly 52% of the U.S. EV

00:03:03.965 --> 00:03:04.425
market.

00:03:05.085 --> 00:03:07.125
Robotaxi service is expected soon.

00:03:07.825 --> 00:03:13.985
BYD, Xiaomi, and X-Pang reported strong sales in China as the year-end push begins, according

00:03:13.985 --> 00:03:15.485
to investors' business daily.

00:03:16.185 --> 00:03:19.185
Tesla faces increased competition in its largest market.

00:03:19.185 --> 00:03:24.185
The three rivals each posted gains that reflect heightened activity ahead of the December

00:03:24.185 --> 00:03:24.705
close.

00:03:25.507 --> 00:03:31.127
Gary Black, in comments carried by Benzinga, stated that Tesla is losing EV share to

00:03:31.127 --> 00:03:33.847
no-name rivals despite its first mover advantage.

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:36.507
He warned that Tesla needs better marketing.

00:03:37.147 --> 00:03:40.507
Newer entrants have gained ground in the US electric vehicle market.

00:03:41.561 --> 00:03:45.761
Rivian outlined an R2 master plan intended to close the gap with Tesla.

00:03:46.381 --> 00:03:47.101
Forbes reported.

00:03:47.101 --> 00:03:50.941
The strategy targets improved competitiveness in the EV market.

00:03:51.461 --> 00:03:56.541
The plan focuses on vehicle positioning and cost structure to challenge Tesla's current offerings.

00:03:57.467 --> 00:04:02.107
A radical makeover is coming for Renault's next McGahn. Auto Express reported.

00:04:02.747 --> 00:04:05.907
The updated model is aimed at challenging the Tesla Model Y.

00:04:06.447 --> 00:04:09.387
It will feature significant design and capability shifts.

00:04:10.107 --> 00:04:15.647
Renault plans to alter core elements of the vehicle to improve competitiveness against the current leader in the segment.

00:04:15.647 --> 00:04:21.733
Top Gear is examining Tesla's claim that the upcoming Roadster will achieve 0-60 miles

00:04:21.733 --> 00:04:24.233
per hour in 0.59 seconds.

00:04:24.753 --> 00:04:29.133
The investigation also covers the rocket-powered flying car elements of the announcement.

00:04:29.753 --> 00:04:34.153
The review questions the technical feasibility of the performance figures released earlier.

00:04:35.069 --> 00:04:40.169
A man encountered 55 of the world's best modified Tesla Cybertrucks at a Texas event.

00:04:40.689 --> 00:04:42.069
Supercar Blondie reported.

00:04:42.069 --> 00:04:47.169
The gathering showcased a wide range of aftermarket alterations applied to the vehicles.

00:04:47.749 --> 00:04:50.409
The custom jobs were described as very wild.

00:04:51.394 --> 00:04:56.354
Tesla's new big screen app does not always activate properly on Android foldables, according

00:04:56.354 --> 00:04:57.614
to not a Tesla app.

00:04:58.194 --> 00:05:02.854
A Tesla engineer confirmed that layout breakpoints will be refined in an upcoming update.

00:05:03.374 --> 00:05:08.174
The change aims to improve compatibility across different screen configurations on foldable

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:08.654
devices.

00:05:08.654 --> 00:05:14.495
A Texas family discovered their missing cat inside their Tesla, the cool-down reported.

00:05:15.035 --> 00:05:17.395
It took 40 minutes to free the cat from the vehicle.

00:05:17.895 --> 00:05:21.155
The search began outside the car and turned to the interior space.

00:05:21.635 --> 00:05:24.655
Tesla FSD logged owner drives in fall conditions.

00:05:25.315 --> 00:05:26.335
Tesla Roddy posted.

00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:31.855
The post captured real-world use of the supervised system on scenic routes with changing foliage.

00:05:32.959 --> 00:05:38.159
Vietnamese goods already carry a 12.5% tariff after the forced labor investigation.

00:05:38.159 --> 00:05:43.199
That rate is the baseline for estimating further pressure on Tesla's bill of materials.

00:05:43.539 --> 00:05:49.919
A broader section 301 action could compound that 12.5% without clear carveouts for high-tech

00:05:49.919 --> 00:05:50.439
components.

00:05:51.179 --> 00:05:56.099
Samsung's filing put roughly $25 billion of committed investment behind the Vietnamese

00:05:56.099 --> 00:05:56.519
hubs.

00:05:57.119 --> 00:06:00.359
The priority country designation is the first in 13 years.

00:06:00.959 --> 00:06:05.459
Tesla has to weigh supply chain resilience against cost targets in ways that ripple through

00:06:05.459 --> 00:06:06.659
multiple product lines.

00:06:06.659 --> 00:06:11.659
engines. Any new duties would raise input costs for vehicles, energy products, and charging

00:06:11.659 --> 00:06:16.479
hardware at the same moment the company is scaling output. The cost increase would likely

00:06:16.479 --> 00:06:21.739
flow directly into vehicle and mega-pack pricing rather than being absorbed through substitution.

00:06:22.319 --> 00:06:26.839
The filing's treat Vietnamese capacity is structurally necessary rather than temporary.

00:06:27.379 --> 00:06:32.119
That sets a longer term constraint on how quickly Tesla can localize its full supply base.

00:06:32.119 --> 00:06:37.299
This trade policy now sits alongside battery chemistry and factory throughput as a direct

00:06:37.299 --> 00:06:38.759
lever on gross margins.

00:06:39.359 --> 00:06:43.379
Component costs can rise without offsetting volume gains or price increases.

00:06:43.919 --> 00:06:47.759
The effect appears first in energy storage and vehicle contribution margins.

00:06:48.359 --> 00:06:50.439
It reaches the income statement after that.

00:06:50.859 --> 00:06:54.799
Tesla is treating the Vietnamese hubs as integral to current production plans.

00:06:55.339 --> 00:06:58.099
A sustained terraforgeem would require price adjustments.

00:06:58.099 --> 00:07:02.459
The other path is margin compression across the affected product families.

00:07:03.019 --> 00:07:07.059
Charging hardware sits in the same cost stack as the cars and the mega-packs.

00:07:07.579 --> 00:07:12.279
Before we go, Tesla's Android foldable layout breakpoint update is the next software

00:07:12.279 --> 00:07:13.259
change name today.

00:07:13.939 --> 00:07:16.159
That covers it for today's Tesla developments.

